#: khtml/khtml_printsettings.cpp:31
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p><strong>'Print images'</strong></p>"
"<p>If this checkbox is enabled, images contained in the HTML page will be "
"printed. Printing may take longer and use more ink or toner.</p>"
"<p>If this checkbox is disabled, only the text of the HTML page will be "
"printed, without the included images. Printing will be faster and use less ink "
"or toner.</p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p><strong>'Sürätlär bastıru'</strong></p>"
"<p>Bi närsä açıq bulsa, HTML bit eçendäge sürätlär dä basılğan bulaçaq. Alay "
"itep bastıru waqıtnı da, buyawnı da kübräk alala.</p>"
"<p>Bi närsä sünek bulsa, HTML bit yazmaları anıñ eçendä bulğan sürätlärsez "
"basılğan bulaçaq. Alay itep bastıru tizräk tä bulala, buyawnıñ da kimräk "
"qullanuı bar.</p> </qt>"

#: khtml/khtml_printsettings.cpp:43
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p><strong>'Print header'</strong></p>"
"<p>If this checkbox is enabled, the printout of the HTML document will contain "
"a header line at the top of each page. This header contains the current date, "
"the location URL of the printed page and the page number.</p>"
"<p>If this checkbox is disabled, the printout of the HTML document will not "
"contain such a header line.</p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p><strong>'Başlıq bastıru'</strong></p>"
"<p>Bi närsä açıq bulsa, HTML bit basılğan çaqta anın aldınnan ber östämä başlıq "
"östälänäçäk. Ul başlıqta bastıru çağı, bit urınlaşuı, basılaçaq bitneñ sanı "
"çığarıla.</p>"
"<p>Bi närsä sünek bulsa, HTML bit andí başlıq östälänmiçä basılaçaq.</p> </qt>"

#: khtml/khtml_printsettings.cpp:56
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p><strong>'Printerfriendly mode'</strong></p>"
"<p>If this checkbox is enabled, the printout of the HTML document will be black "
"and white only, and all colored background will be converted into white. "
"Printout will be faster and use less ink or toner.</p>"
"<p>If this checkbox is disabled, the printout of the HTML document will happen "
"in the original color settings as you see in your application. This may result "
"in areas of full-page color (or grayscale, if you use a black+white printer). "
"Printout will possibly happen slower and will certainly use much more toner or "
"ink.</p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p><strong>'Basaq İptäşe'</strong></p>"
"<p>Bi närsä açıq bulsa, HTML bit aq-qara töstä genä basılaçaq, tösle artyaqlar "
"aq bulıp sanalaçaq. Alay itep bastıru waqıtnı da, buyawnı da kimräk alala.</p>"
"<p>Bi närsä sünek bulsa, HTML bit küräktä kürsätelgänençä basılaçaq, yäğni "
"basaq tösle bulsa, tulıtösle itep çığaçaq. Alay itep bastıru waqıtnı da, "
"buyawnı da kübräk alala.</p> </qt>"

